.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-mora-wait 1  "wait " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-wait \- Wait for matching tags or branches to exist or disappear
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora wait\fR [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-branch\fR] [\fB\-\-agent\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-target\fR] [\fB\-\-attempt\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-topic\fR] [\fB\-\-absent\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Wait for matching tags or branches to exist or disappear
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<pattern>\fR
Ordinary tag name pattern, e.g. \*(Aqpending/main/*\*(Aq
.TP
\fB\-\-branch\fR \fI<pattern>\fR
Ordinary branch name pattern, e.g. \*(Aqagent/alice/*\*(Aq
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\-id\fR \fI<id>\fR
Parsed agent, or the current branch association for a tag
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fI<name>\fR
Target encoded in a workflow name
.TP
\fB\-\-attempt\-id\fR \fI<id>\fR
Attempt encoded in a workflow name
.TP
\fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<id>\fR
Direct topic membership of the pointed\-to commit
.TP
\fB\-\-absent\fR
Wait until no names satisfy the filters
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<d>\fR
Stop after this duration (exit 3)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
